config BR2_PACKAGE_INGENIC_OSDRV_T41
	bool "ingenic-osdrv-t41"
	select BR2_PACKAGE_INGENIC_OPENSDK
	select BR2_PACKAGE_UCLIBC_COMPAT
	help
	  ingenic-osdrv-t41 - Ingenic T41 libs, sensor data and module loader

	  The kernel modules themselves are built from source by
	  ingenic-opensdk; this package carries the userspace MPP
	  libraries, the sensor description and ISP tuning data, and
	  the load_ingenic script.

	  https://openipc.org
